{"id":"n27817-1-7","stage":2,"title":"축구장 · 足球场","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n27817-1-7-1","ko":"저기에 뭘 짓는데 저렇게 공사 규모가 커요?","zh":"那边在搞什么工程，规模怎么会这么大啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저기에","meaning":"那里，那儿","explanation":"저기：那里，那儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71218","senseId":"1","lemma":"저기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저기에","audio":"/audio/f93d780041b136d31a70.mp3"}},{"text":"뭘","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭘","audio":"/audio/441ab920d2baa0d1bea5.mp3"}},{"text":"짓는데","meaning":"做，造，建","explanation":"짓다：做，造，建；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"짓다","audio":"/audio/e17bf0fed41df779832d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66585","senseId":"1","lemma":"짓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"짓는데","audio":"/audio/b23ffbdccc57f02037c1.mp3"}},{"text":"저렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"저렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"저렇다","audio":"/audio/07e99c1628a5077b51a7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71226","senseId":"1","lemma":"저렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저렇게","audio":"/audio/3e51b4147d3689f85089.mp3"}},{"text":"공사","meaning":"工程，施工","explanation":"공사：工程，施工。","readings":[{"term":"공사","audio":"/audio/25e51843741edb403b41.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23401","senseId":"1","lemma":"공사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공사","audio":"/audio/25e51843741edb403b41.mp3"}},{"text":"규모가","meaning":"规模","explanation":"규모：规模；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"규모","audio":"/audio/c238359b8033a59e4feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37054","senseId":"1","lemma":"규모","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"규모가","audio":"/audio/7ae10c9eeae5662b41f8.mp3"}},{"text":"커요?","meaning":"大，高，长，壮阔","explanation":"크다：大，高，长，壮阔；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"1","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"커요","audio":"/audio/f9f55e152f7b9cc0aeaa.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1a8b5723b01cfd93","term":"저기","zh":"那里，那儿","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3","entryId":"71218","definition":"指代离说话人或听话人很远的地方。","pronunciation":["저기"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"e17bf0fed41df779","term":"짓다","zh":"做，造，建","audio":"/audio/e17bf0fed41df779832d.mp3","entryId":"66585","definition":"用材料煮饭、缝衣服、造房子等。","pronunciation":["짇ː따"]},{"id":"07e99c1628a5077b","term":"저렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/07e99c1628a5077b51a7.mp3","entryId":"71226","definition":"性质、模样、状态等与那个一样。","pronunciation":["저러타"]},{"id":"25e51843741edb40","term":"공사","zh":"工程，施工","audio":"/audio/25e51843741edb403b41.mp3","entryId":"23401","definition":"重新建造或改造设施或建筑物。","pronunciation":["공사"]},{"id":"c238359b8033a59e","term":"규모","zh":"规模","audio":"/audio/c238359b8033a59e4feb.mp3","entryId":"37054","definition":"东西或现象的大小或范围。","pronunciation":["규모"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"大，高，长，壮阔","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66586","definition":"长度、宽度、高度、体积等都超出了普通程度。","pronunciation":["크다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e852cdb5049250d6e368.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n27817-1-7-2","ko":"축구장을 새로 짓는대요.","zh":"说是要新建一个足球场呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"축구장을","meaning":"足球场","explanation":"축구장：足球场；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"축구장","audio":"/audio/4a98ecdd5ee6a65fa492.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27817","senseId":"1","lemma":"